Vup2 up 0 PULSE(1.2 0 5u 10p 10p 5u 20u)
Vdn2 dn 0 PULSE(0 1.2 15u 10p 10p 5u 20u)
x1 vp up vout dn 0 NEW_500n_cp_cell
